        "cooked": "<p>Edit - grumble grumble too used to reddit’s way of doing things.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/podcast/editors-note-72\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/podcast/editors-note-72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7be30de501a68cfd7fd413adc419c5c20b436a25.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/podcast/editors-note-72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #72</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We're back! It's been too long! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:28:07 We talk about songs, do some goofs, and reveal an already revealed schedule! Upcoming schedule:    Tuesday, November 7th: Episode #266: GloomWeaver vs. Æternus   Tuesday, November...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>\nRecapping the schedule for November that was already determined.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, November 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#266:</span> GloomWeaver vs. Æternus</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 14th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#267:</span> Prime Wardens in the Egyptian Underworld</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 21st: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#73</span>\n</li>\n<li>Tuesday, November 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#268:</span> Grimm: Lord of the Harvest</li>\n</ul>",
